# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# Tauri updater signing key. The matching public key (tauri.pubkey) IS
# committed; only the private key must never enter the repository. Store the
# private key in a CI secret (TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY or
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH) before running `tauri build`.
/tauri.key
